{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>You are now entering the nonplace.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Nonplace</i> is a surreal, liminal horror game about exploring spaces that almost make sense.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> You play from a first-person perspective with no combat and no map. Your only goal is to move forward and document what doesn\u2019t belong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players catalog visual inconsistencies, misplaced objects, architectural impossibilities, and other eerie details.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>First-person exploration</strong> with minimal UI</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Checklist mechanic for environmental discrepancies\u00a0</strong>\u2014 spot and log what\u2019s wrong</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Non-linear progression</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Shifting, surreal environments</strong> inspired by liminal spaces</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are <i>not</i> the protagonist.<br>You are an <strong>unwelcome</strong>\u00a0<strong>witness</strong> to something that was never meant to be seen.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3788330?t=1749227724","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788330/8e9b4b4508148100cdcaa7da8b712a0573d053c2/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749227724","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788330/b32cfff7392a3e6a2a98e582b51c5e5307a89314/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749227724","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788330/b32cfff7392a3e6a2a98e582b51c5e5307a89314/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749227724","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids